# Icarus AI

This is a Godot 4 GDScript game. Summer Engine is an optional development environment, not a runtime dependency.

- Inspect existing systems before adding new ones.
- Keep authoritative game state in the engine. Treat LLM output as untrusted input.
- After code or scene changes, run `.\scripts\test.ps1`. Use `.\scripts\build.ps1` and `.\scripts\play.ps1` before calling a change playable.
- Work on feature branches. Do not treat the working tree as disposable.
- Do not add Summer SDK APIs or other editor-only dependencies to shipped game code.
- Do not implement Living Town RPG systems unless explicitly asked. Bootstrap the edit → test → build → play loop first.
- Prefer simple implementations. Refactor when the pain is real.
